{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126215924522-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126222604\"/><p>今午(26日)1時19分，屯門嘉和里山路一名姓李(60歲)女住戶報案，指懷疑其住所遭爆竊。人員接報到場，發現上址一房間窗戶被撬毀，李婦經初步點算，相信一隻約值12萬港元手錶和共值約61萬港元的金器失去。經初步調查，案件列作「爆竊」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:03:59.459931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:59:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:57:20.925988+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:57:20.925988+00:00","content_hash":"002ac3e27450c467ec29e391e3fbc777a148702bb11747420167b43b42701f56","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}